    "chunk_text": "(4) A member appointed under subsection (3) shall holdoffice for the unexpired period of the term of office of themember whom he succeeds.\n\nDisqualificationfrom being amember of theBoard.\n\nRemoval andresignation ofmembers.\n\n3National Enterprise Development AuthorityAct, No. 17 of 2006\n\n(2) An appointed member who has been removed fromoffice shall not be eligible for reappointment as a member ofthe Board or to serve the Authority in any other capacity.\n\n7.(1) The Chairman of the Board shall, if present presideat every meeting of the Board. In the absence of the Chairmanfrom any such meeting the members present shall elect oneof the members present to preside at such meeting.\n\n(2) The quorum for any meeting of the Board shall be fourmembers.\n\n(3) Subject to the preceding provisions of this section,the Board may regulate the procedure in regard to themeetings of the Board and the transaction of business at suchmeetings.\n\n8.The members of the Board shall be paid remunerationout of the Fund of the Authority at such rates as may bedetermined by the Minister, with the concurrence of theMinister in charge of the subject of Finance.\n\n9. No act, decision or proceeding of the Board shall bedeemed to be invalid by reason only of the existence of anyvacancy in the Board or of any defect in the appointment ofany member thereof.\n\n10.In the exercise of its powers, discharge of itsfunctions and performance of its duties, the Authority shallcomply with the general policy of the Government and withany general or special directions issued to it by the Ministerin relation to the implementation of such policy,\n\nMeetings of theBoard.\n\nRemuneration ofmembers.\n\nActs notinvalidated byreason of avacancy.\n\nAuthority tocomply with thegeneral policyof theGovernment.\n\nTerm of officeof members.\n\n4National Enterprise Development AuthorityAct, No. 17 of 2006\n\n11.(1) The seal of the Authority shall be in the custodyof such person as the Board may decide from time to time."
